00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:47.920
-Well, come on.
Pastrami sandwich or...?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.021
-Pastrami sa-- Yes, right?

00:04:49.021 --> 00:04:51.256
Pastrami sandwich,
