00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.139
-[ Laughing ] Oh!

00:05:07.139 --> 00:05:09.041
-That's been there
the whole time.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:10.343
-T, come on.
-And can you tell everyone

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.378
