Foodie Magished!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.127
-[ Laughs ]

00:06:02.127 --> 00:06:04.363
-Thank you.
-Come on.

00:06:04.363 --> 00:06:06.432
Got Foodie Magished!
-You just got Foodie Magished!

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:09.635
-I got Foodie Magished!
This is my man, Josh Beckerman.

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:12.004
The Foodie Magician.

